Description: Boshiamy input method support for fcitx5
 Fcitx5 is the next generation of fcitx input method framework.
 .
 This package provides a standalone Boshiamy input method engine for
 fcitx5 with native support for Speed Mode (,,sp), dynamic homophone
 lookup (` prefix), Simplified/Traditional switching (,,c/,,t), wildcard
 lookup (* and ?), V/R/S/F selection, custom dictionary reload (,,r),
 reverse code lookup (,,q), and typing statistics (,,st).
